<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $47-3/8 (FIM 216.05).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $47-3/8 (FIM 216.05).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-7/8 at $47-3/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 216.05 markka. In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed down 0.50 markka at 213.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/4 at $31-5/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 72.11 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.50 markka at 72.20.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $18 on Friday. The price equals about 82.09 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma closed up 0.30 markka at 82.80 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
